  "summary": "GraphQL Playground is a GraphQL IDE built on GraphiQL components, distributed as a Yarn-workspaces monorepo containing a React core, an HTML renderer, four framework middlewares, and an Electron app; the evidence documents its interfaces, dependencies, and two documented XSS vulnerabilities with patched versions.",
